nats:
  inbound:
    - subject_env: NEXUS_NATS_PREFIX
      description: |
        Subject prefix for Nexus Tamagotchi event-space. Stage 1 only validates
        and stores prefix configuration; later stages attach concrete subjects.
  outbound:
    - subject_env: NEXUS_NATS_PREFIX
      description: |
        Prefix used for all agent events. Full subject composition is added in
        future stages to keep this foundation module vendor-neutral.
public_contract: true
notes: |
  Stage 1 provides the public TypeScript foundation: core types, registries,
  progression map, audit hash-chain, and constitutional council stub. Private
  CNWB runtime behavior remains outside this repository.